<title>NETHERLANDS: DUTCH BOURSE CANDIDATE CSS POSTS HIGHER Q1 PROFIT.</title>
<headline>DUTCH BOURSE CANDIDATE CSS POSTS HIGHER Q1 PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>HOUTEN, Netherlands 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     0.85 vs   0.56</p>
<p>    Turnover				 5.8  vs   3.9</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     1.3  vs   0.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Computer Services Solutions Holding NV said it</p>
<p>expected the first quarter trend to continue in the rest of</p>
<p>1997. Earlier this month, CSS said it would seek a listing on</p>
<p>the New Market of the Amsterdam Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
